# ── Capacitor native Android project ────────────────────────────────────
# android/ IS committed (Capacitor convention — see MedIndex-/Elite-Notebook-
# for the same pattern), just not its build outputs, dependency caches, local
# machine config, or the web bundle it gets on every `npx cap sync` (already
# tracked once, as source, under src/public — no need to duplicate it here).
android/app/build
android/.gradle
android/local.properties
android/captures
android/*.iml
android/.idea
android/app/google-services.json
android/app/src/main/assets/public
